---
globs: *.go
alwaysApply: false
---
- Always use `use-modern-go` skill working on .go files
- Never pass full request(*http.Request) to methods, extract the needed keys and only passed them
- Don't use deprecated versions of libraries
- Only use uber-mock package for generating mock file for package
- Use format for creating mock file package/mocks/package_mock.go
- Use format for creating test file package/package_test.go
- Prefer to write test-cases in parallel, and self independent which does not share global common variables or anything that can cause issue while running them in parallel via `t.Parallel()`
- Create unit-tests in Parent-child structure
- Write smaller test cases, prefer high quality test cases and integration test cases for user flow
- Use Interface pattern for dependency injection
